Anyone may fork Garden, merge it into another project, change its rules, remove parts, rename it, create incompatible versions, or build something entirely different from it under rights validly granted by this license.

4. No maintenance, certification, or endorsement obligation

Use of Garden does not make an implementation official, certified, safe, correct, or endorsed. The original author has no obligation to maintain, review, approve, support, govern, or update downstream uses.

5. Third-party material

This notice grants only rights controlled by the Garden project owner. Third-party materials remain subject to their own applicable licenses and rights notices.

6. Earlier Garden restrictions

Older repository files, snapshots, branches, commits, or documents may contain earlier restrictive or conditional Garden licensing language. For rights controlled by the Garden project owner, this root LICENSE supersedes those earlier project-imposed restrictions from 2026-10-06 forward.

SUMMARY

Garden is currently free for everyone.

If that free status is ever changed for rights or value that remain controllable, the intended alternative is the Garden Common Fund under large-scale randomized, rotating, politically independent and capture-resistant democratic governance.

There is no intended third option.
